# PSR-7f — Branch-protection print ratchet

## Intent

Advance R-BRANCH without GitHub API writes:

- `ops:branch-protection:print` lists required check contexts
- Local name-drift verifier (`verify-required-check-names.mjs`) stays green
- **No** `--verify` / apply (needs `gh` auth + Architect YES)

## Commands

```bash
pnpm run ops:branch-protection:print
node scripts/ops/verify-required-check-names.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-7f-branch-protection-print-smoke.mjs
```

## Next

Architect YES → `pnpm run ops:branch-protection:verify` on release SHA.
Or fill tip RC pack draft from PSR-7e schema under `reports/psr/`.
